## Performance Directives

```ts
// Mandatory memoization pattern
const customerMetric = useMemo(
  () => calculateMetrics(rawTransactions),
  [rawTransactions]
);

// Immutable updates using immer's produce
const newSegments = produce(existingSegments, (draft) => {
  draft.push(...validatedSegments);
});
```

